  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cooperative selection cocoa mass processing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project has the objective to find the local partner for a cluster on small-scale local cocoa processing in C&#xf4;te d&#x2019;Ivoire.It will contribute to the sustainable development of the cocoa sector in C&#xf4;te d&#x2019;Ivoire, hence creating opportunities for local (youth) employment, a more ecologically friendly value chain and business opportunities for Dutch products and services that can support this development.This activity is part of a bigger programmatic approach called the &quot;combi-approach&quot;, coordinated by the Netherlands government.</narrative>
  </description>
